/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
50 780 Td
(On-Board Diagnostics and Brakes \(synthetic sample\)) '
() '
(OBD-II is the standard diagnostic interface found on passenger cars. A scan tool) '
(connects to the 16 pin connector under the dashboard and reads diagnostic trouble) '
(codes. A code such as P0301 reports a cylinder 1 misfire. The malfunction indicator) '
(lamp turns on when the engine control unit stores an emissions related fault.) '
() '
(Hydraulic disc brakes press brake pads against a rotor. Brake fluid transfers pedal) '
(force to the calipers, and the fluid absorbs water over time, which lowers its) '
(boiling point. Anti-lock braking uses wheel speed sensors to release pressure when a) '
(wheel is about to lock.) '
() '
(Tire pressure monitoring systems warn the driver when a tire loses more than a set) '
(share of its pressure. Direct systems use a sensor inside each wheel, indirect) '
(systems compare wheel speeds.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
